CM Element 1: magnitude=1, phase=0°
EX 0 1 11 0 1.0 0.0
CM Element 2: magnitude=1, phase=−90° (quadrature hybrid)
EX 0 2 11 0 0.0 -1.0
CM Note: (0.0 + j×−1.0) = 1∠−90°

CM === FREQUENCY ===
FR 0 1 0 0 14.175 0

